{"id":"4287c6698956536c","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-filter7-ultrafilter-sum.md","title":"ZFC Filter7 Ultrafilter Sum","display":"df-zfc-filter7-ultrafilter-sum — ZFC Filter7 Ultrafilter Sum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter7-ultrafilter-sum","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter7-ultrafilter-sum"],"display":"df-zfc-filter7-ultrafilter-sum — ZFC Filter7 Ultrafilter Sum","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-ultrafilter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter7-ultrafilter-sum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter7-ultrafilter-sum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter7-ultrafilter-sum — ZFC Filter7 Ultrafilter Sum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\mathcal U,\\vec X,\\vec{\\mathcal V},\\mathcal X,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal W\\in V\">\\(I,\\mathcal U,\\vec X,\\vec{\\mathcal V},\\mathcal X,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal W\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7UltrafilterSum}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7UltrafilterSum}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}sum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7UltrafilterSum}_S(I,\\mathcal U,\\vec X,\\vec{\\mathcal V},\\mathcal W)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\mathcal X,\\mathcal F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,I,\\mathcal X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal V},I,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,I){}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\vec{\\mathcal V}(i),\\vec X(i)){}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathcal W=\n\\Bigl\\{A\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in I}(\\{i\\}\\times\\vec X(i)):\\\n\\{i\\in I:\\{x\\in\\vec X(i):\\langle i,x\\rangle\\in A\\}\n\\in\\vec{\\mathcal V}(i)\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr).{}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}sum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7UltrafilterSum}_S(I,\\mathcal U,\\vec X,\\vec{\\mathcal V},\\mathcal W)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\mathcal X,\\mathcal F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,I,\\mathcal X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal V},I,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,I){}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\vec{\\mathcal V}(i),\\vec X(i)){}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathcal W=\n\\Bigl\\{A\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in I}(\\{i\\}\\times\\vec X(i)):\\\n\\{i\\in I:\\{x\\in\\vec X(i):\\langle i,x\\rangle\\in A\\}\n\\in\\vec{\\mathcal V}(i)\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr).{}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two fibre families are genuine functions with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>; their values, rather than an unconstrained display tuple, determine the disjoint-union carrier and the fibre ultrafilters.</li>\n<li>Both the index ultrafilter and every fibre ultrafilter are required explicitly. The unrelated submodule-sum dependency has been removed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[58-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,\\mathcal U,\\vec X,\\vec{\\mathcal V},\\mathcal X,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal W\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7UltrafilterSum}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}sum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7UltrafilterSum}_S(I,\\mathcal U,\\vec X,\\vec{\\mathcal V},\\mathcal W)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&\\exists\\mathcal X,\\mathcal F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,I,\\mathcal X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal V},I,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,I){}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\vec{\\mathcal V}(i),\\vec X(i)){}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathcal W=\n\\Bigl\\{A\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in I}(\\{i\\}\\times\\vec X(i)):\\\n\\{i\\in I:\\{x\\in\\vec X(i):\\langle i,x\\rangle\\in A\\}\n\\in\\vec{\\mathcal V}(i)\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr).{}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false}],"bytes":1738,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1930","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-filter7-ultrafilter-sum.md|58-df-zfc-filter7-ultrafilter-sum]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8"]}